- Source file hashes: [`source_manifest.json`](../../run_log/one_bar_dukascopy_2013_2026_20261011/source_manifest.json)
- Calendar verification: [`calendar_qualification.json`](../../run_log/one_bar_dukascopy_2013_2026_20261011/calendar_qualification.json)
